            [
                'title' => 'Maximizing ROI with Digital Marketing',
                'slug' => 'maximizing-roi-digital-marketing',
                'content' => '<h2>Understanding Digital Marketing ROI</h2><p>Return on Investment (ROI) is the ultimate measure of digital marketing success. Here how to maximize your returns.</p><h2>Key Strategies</h2><h3>1. Set Clear Objectives</h3><p>Define what success looks like for your campaigns. Clear goals lead to better strategies and measurable results.</p><h3>2. Target the Right Audience</h3><p>Use data and analytics to understand your audience. Targeted campaigns always perform better than generic ones.</p><h3>3. Optimize Your Funnel</h3><p>Every stage of the customer journey needs attention. Optimize each touchpoint to improve overall conversion rates.</p><h3>4. Test and Iterate</h3><p>A/B testing, user surveys, and analytics provide insights for continuous improvement.</p><h3>5. Focus on Content Quality</h3><p>Quality content builds trust and authority. Invest in creating valuable, relevant content for your audience.</p><h2>Measurement and Analytics</h2><p>Use tools like Google Analytics, social media insights, and email marketing metrics to track performance. Make data-driven decisions.</p><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Digital marketing ROI isn just about spending less—it about spending smarter. Focus on strategies that deliver real value to your business.</p>',
                'meta_title' => 'Maximizing ROI with Digital Marketing',
                'meta_description' => 'Learn proven strategies to maximize your digital marketing return on investment.',
                'published' => true,
